     3	Sources folded in: astra contract review (`ADJUDICATION-STAGES-6-8-CONTRACT-CODEX-GPT6-ASTRA-2026-09-08.md`), round-7 outside opinions (Q&A + Deep Research), pipeline audits B/C/D, first-principles review. All three reviewers returned `CONTRACT=REVISE`, `C3_IDENTIFIABLE=NO` as written, `POWERED=NO`; v1 resolves each named item. Nothing here is conditioned on any outcome.
